<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Patterson targets raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Patterson targets raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Monday it raised its price targets for the stock of Patterson Dental Co to $38 from $34 for the six months and to $43 from $39 for the 18 months.</p>
<p>--Analyst Kevin Silverman in a report reiterated his intermediate and long-term outperform ratings on the company.</p>
<p>--Patterson, a distributor of dental supplies and equipment, ended trade up 3/8 at 34-3/8.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
